<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Olympic Financial starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Olympic Financial starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Steve Eisman has started coverage of Olympic Financial Ltd with a rating of sell, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Eisman set a $6 target price for the Minneapolis company's shares. They closed on Monday at 14-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Eisman was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
